/u/33495614?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000","html_url":"https://github.com/Jojo-1000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jojo-1000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T16:40:49Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T16:40:49Z","body":"> Translation parser changes will conflict with #108909 🤔 (which makes the methods conditionally required)\r\n\r\nI can leave those parts out if you want.\r\n\r\nThanks for taking a look. I think keeping the if for video_stream should work, right? I was under the impression that the calls won't fail any more, but that seems to be wrong. I should probably also keep the if for ResourceFormatLoader as well, so it doesn't pass back success.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137094640/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137127688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107989#issuecomment-3137127688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107989","id":3137127688,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66_MUI","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","av